Note that potions of full healilng *are* available in the early game.
Random item generation isn't governed by dungeon depth in nethack, as it 
is in some other roguelikes, like moria.
They just aren't that common, so you're much less likely to have 
encountered any.

Also, in the early game, you don't often kill creatures in a single hit, 
so you usually give them a chance to actually *use* a carried potion of 
[full|extra] healing. When you start killing them in one blow, they 
leave their spoils.

